  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "BotzoneBenchDataset",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Card for BotzoneBenchDataset\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Description\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tDataset Summary\n\t\n\nBotzoneBenchDataset is a structured JSONL version of the raw evaluation logs released with BotzoneBench, an anchored evaluation framework for large language models in multi-game decision-making settings.\nThis dataset separates two complementary views of the same benchmark:\n\nllm_single and llm_tournament: turn-level LLM interaction records containing prompts, optional reasoning traces… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/AMysteriousBeing/BotzoneBenchDataset.",
